# ---- Lead data: NEVER commit (consumer PII + far over GitHub size limits) ----
# These hold names, personal emails, mobile numbers, home addresses, income
# range, net worth, marital/children status. Git history is permanent, so once
# any of this is committed it cannot be cleanly removed. Keep it in S3/RDS only.
DataMoon/
exports/
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
overlap_history.sql

# Small aggregate reports (counts only, no PII) are allowed back in:
!RECURRING_WORKED_LEADS_REPORT.txt
!docs/**/*.md
